USDA
United States Department of Agriculture
Research, Education, and Economics
Agricultural Research Service
IAPPROVED
May 7, 2021
By Alessandra at 10:14 am, May 07, 2021J
City Clerk’s Office
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Room 101
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
Dear Sir or Madam:
SUBJECT: Notice of Renewal: Lease Number 57-8211W-1-0171, 1,998 Acres of Land
City Contract #150
Annual rent is $1.00, receipt of which is acknowledged
In accordance with the terms of the above-referenced lease, the United States of America, acting by
and through the Agricultural Research Service, is sending this notice of renewal to provide you with
30 days’ notice of its option to renew said lease for the period of 10/1/202 1 through 9/30/2022. All
conditions and provisions of the said lease and any amendments thereto, are hereby extended to
cover the renewal option period.
The considerations, acts, promises, agreements, and provisions to be executed and performed by
each party to said lease shall remain in full force and effect for the above-referenced period. This
renewal is conditioned upon the passages of an applicable appropriation or authorization by
Congress from which this expenditure may be made and shall not obligate the United States upon
failure of Congress to so act.
If you concur with extending the renewal for one more period as listed above, please initial the
concurrence line below and retain a copy for your files before returning this notice to the address
below.
Lessor Concurrence:
________________________
(initials)
Sincerely,
L I S L\ B/\El E
Digitally signed by LISA BAETE
Date: 2021.05.07 10:05:18 -06,00’
LISA M. BAETE
Lease Contracting Officer
Administrative & Financial Management
Plains Area
2150 Centre Avenue, Building D, Suite 300
Fort Collins, CO 80526-8119
Phone: 970-492-7071
Fax: 970-492-7049
Email: Lisa.Baete@usda.gov
USDA is an Equal Opportunity Provider and Employer
